---

<BaseLayout
  title="Hakkımda | Ali Sağırvelioğulları"
  description="Ali Sağırvelioğulları - Senior Database Administrator & AWS Certified Data Engineer. SunExpress, TÜBİTAK BİLGEM ve Türk Hava Yolları kariyer yolculuğu, sertifikaları ve teknik uzmanlıkları."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    
    <!-- Hero / Intro -->
    <header class="mb-14 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        <span>Kişisel Profil & Kariyer</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Hakkımda
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Ben <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Ali Sağırvelioğulları</strong>. 
        Kritik veri sistemlerinin güvenliği, sürekliliği ve performansı üzerine uzmanlaşmış bir 
        <strong class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Senior Database Administrator (DBA)</strong> ve 
        <strong class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-semibold">AWS Certified Data Engineer</strong>'ım.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Bio Section -->
    <section class="mb-16 space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg">
      <p>
        Veritabanı yöneticiliğine olan tutkum, verinin bir uygulamanın "kalbi" olduğunu ve en ufak bir veri bozulması ya da kesintinin doğrudan iş süreçlerini durdurabildiğini fark ettiğimde başladı. Kariyerim boyunca havacılık (<strong>SunExpress</strong>, <strong>Türk Hava Yolları</strong>), kritik kamu güvenliği ve sertifikasyon altyapıları (<strong>TÜBİTAK BİLGEM</strong>) ile teknoloji danışmanlığı sektörlerinde görev aldım.
      </p>
      <p>
        Günlük çalışmalarımda; <strong>PostgreSQL</strong>, <strong>Oracle</strong>, <strong>MSSQL</strong> ve <strong>AWS Bulut</strong> ortamlarının mimari tasarımı, kernel seviyesinde Linux I/O optimizasyonu, <strong>Patroni & Oracle Data Guard</strong> ile yüksek erişilebilirlik (HA), <strong>pgBackRest</strong> ile Point-in-Time Recovery (PITR) ve <strong>Python & Terraform</strong> ile altyapı otomasyon süreçlerine odaklanıyorum.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- DBA Philosophy -->
    <section class="mb-16 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
        Çalışma İlkelerim ve Mühendislik Felsefem
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        {philosophies.map((item) => (
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-dark-card border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-dark-cardBorder shadow-sm space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
              {item.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              {item.desc}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Career Timeline -->
    <section class="mb-16 space-y-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500"></span>
        Kariyer Yolculuğu
      </h2>

      <div class="relative border-l-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 ml-3 sm:ml-4 space-y-10 pl-6 sm:pl-8">
        {timeline.map((item) => (
          <div class="relative group">
            <!-- Dot -->
            <div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-dark-bg border-4 border-emerald-500"></div>

            <div class="space-y-2">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-2">
                <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800">
                  {item.period}
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono">
                  ({item.duration})
                </span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                {item.role}
              </h3>

              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span>{item.company}</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600">•</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">{item.location}</span>
              </div>

              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed pt-1">
                {item.description}
              </p>

              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2">
                {item.skills.map((skill) => (
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700/80">
                    {skill}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Professional Certifications -->
    <section class="mb-16 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Resmi Sertifikalar & Yetkinlikler
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
            Doğrulanabilir küresel sertifikasyonlar ve akreditasyonlar.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        {certifications.map((cert) => (
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-dark-card border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-dark-cardBorder flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow transition-all group">
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span class={`text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded border ${cert.color}`}>
                  {cert.badge}
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                  {cert.date}
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 leading-snug pt-1">
                {cert.name}
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-medium">
                {cert.issuer}
              </p>
            </div>

            {cert.url && (
              <div class="pt-4 mt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <a
                  href={cert.url}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-500 group-hover:underline"
                >
                  <span>Yeterlilik Belgesini Doğrula</span>
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                  </svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            )}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Trainings and Development Courses -->
    <section class="mb-16 space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
          Tamamlanan Mesleki Eğitimler & Kurslar
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
          Sürekli gelişim ve uzmanlaşma kapsamında tamamlanan mesleki eğitim programları.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        {trainings.map((t) => (
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-dark-card border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-dark-cardBorder flex flex-col justify-between space-y-2.5 text-xs shadow-sm">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px] mb-1">
                <span class="font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">{t.provider}</span>
                <span>{t.date}</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 text-sm leading-snug">
                {t.title}
              </h3>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                {t.tags.map((tag) => (
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                    {tag}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
              {t.url && (
                <a
                  href={t.url}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1"
                >
                  <span>Belge</span>
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                  </svg>
                </a>
              )}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tech Stack in About -->
    <section class="mb-16 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500"></span>
        Yönetilen Altyapı ve Teknolojiler
      </h2>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
        {competencies.map((comp) => (
          <TechBadge name={comp} />
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
